---
source: crates/lighthouse-cli/tests/it/surface.rs
expression: "printed(dir.path(), &args)"
---
Write the decision docs, the command and tool references, and the skill

Usage: lighthouse docs generate [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <FILE>  The project file; the project root is then the current directory [env: LIGHTHOUSE_CONFIG=]
      --out <OUT>      [default: docs]
      --color <COLOR>  Color of help and messages. `auto` honours NO_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE [env: LIGHTHOUSE_COLOR=] [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --skill <SKILL>  Where the generated agent skill goes [default: skills/lighthouse/SKILL.md]
  -h, --help           Print help
